OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric carriage vandalised ahead
OL,4,Aof Santa trains
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic train carriage has been
OL,7,Fvandalised at the East Lancashire
OL,8,FRailway ahead of the start of its
OL,9,Fpopular Christmas services.
OL,11,FOn Saturday, staff in Bury discovered
OL,12,Fone of the doors had been smashed,
OL,13,Fanother badly damaged and food and
OL,14,Fdrink scattered inside the 1950s buffet
OL,15,Fcar.
OL,17,FGeneral manager Lee Kenny said repairs
OL,18,Fcould take weeks, delaying other
OL,19,Fmaintenance work by the railway's team
OL,20,Fof staff and volunteers.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
