OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric carriage vandalised ahead
OL,4,Aof Santa trains
OL,5,
OL,6,FKenny said the Santa Special steam
OL,7,Ftrains - from Bury to Rawtenstall in
OL,8,FLancashire and back - would still run
OL,9,Fas planned on selected dates from 28
OL,10,FNovember until 24 December.
